talian GemVin Investigators and the National Cancer Institute of Canada Clinical Trials Group</collab></person-group><article-title>Gemcitabine plus vinorelbine compared to cisplatin plus vinorelbine or cisplatin plus gemcitabine for advanced non-small-cell lung cancer. A phase III trial of the Italian GEMVIN Investigators and the National Cancer Institute of Canada &#x02013; Clinical Trials Group</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>2003a</year>in press</citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gridelli</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Perrone</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Gallo</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Cigolari</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Rossi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Piantedosi</surname><given-names>FV</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbera</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Ferra&#x000f9;</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Piazza</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosetti</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Clerici</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bertetto</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Robbiati</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name><name><surname>Frontini</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Sacco</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Castiglione</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Favaretto</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Novello</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Migliorino</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Gasparini</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Galetta</surname><given-names>D</given-names>