ity and response criteria of the Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group</article-title><source>Am J Clin Oncol</source><year>1982</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>649</fpage><lpage>655</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Am J Clin Oncol||5|649||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7165009</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Repetto</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Balducci</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A case for geriatric oncology</article-title><source>Lancet Oncol</source><year>2002</year><volume>3</volume><supplement>5</supplement><fpage>289</fpage><lpage>297</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Lancet Oncol||3|289||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12067806</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Strand</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name><name><surname>Morley</surname><given-names>PC</given-names></name><name><surname>Cipolle</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ramsey</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Lamsam</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Drug-related problems: their structure and function</article-title><source>DICP</source><year>1990</year><volume>24</volume><supplement>11</supplement><fpage>1093</fpage><lpage>1097</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'DICP||24|1093||bib15|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2275235</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>The Elderly Lung cancer Vinorelbine Italian Study (ELVIS) group</collab></person-group><article-title>Effects of vinorelbine on quality of life and survival of elderly patients with advanced non small cell lung cancer</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>1999</year><vo